  <Widget no="2" caption="check yourself" widget="quiz" config={protoQuizCfg} />
  <p>
    <strong>What to notice:</strong> each question asks you to match a representation to a
    question - physical or drawn, exact or rough, polished or grey. Read the explanations
    even for answers you got right: the wrong options are the plausible mismatches, and
    spotting a fidelity error before it costs a workshop day is the skill.
